                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="f6_note1" value="On approve, a failed rule re-check (e.g. new blackout, club no longer Active) or a conflict with a reason while the policy disables overbooking is refused (409); the booking stays Under Review. Bookings attached to an event proposal skip the claim and decision above: they move with the proposal (submit → Under Review, plus bookings created for non-room sessions; approve → Approved after a conflict check; revision → Revision Requested; reject → Released). Event cancellation or reschedule releases bookings; club suspension and dissolution cancel them." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="1928.0399999999997" width="786" height="98" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
